the plant life and the animal life. Besides these two, additional life forms thrive on earth, but are more difficult to see with the unaided eye. This is why the flora and fauna, i.e., plant and wildlife of the earth, are captivating to observe and study. Flora and fauna are terms originating from Latin. Flora in Latin signifies the goddess of the flower. Flora is also derived from the word floral, which means pertaining to flowers. Therefore flora is a collection of native plants in an ecosystem of a geographic region. The origin of the word fauna is somewhat veiled in mystery. According to Roman mythology, Fauna denotes the goddess of fertility. Fauna is occasionally referred to as Fauns, meaning forest spirits. By definition, fauna is a collection of native animals of any geographic region. So, the term flora and fauna was created by biologists to denote a collection of plant and animal species in a specific geographic location. This is why you encounter phrases like flora and fauna of India, flora and fauna of Indonesia, and so forth.19:[\"$\",\"li\",\"d0523e78-1bbd-4f2b-bb29-0d1c073be010\",{\"id\":\"item-2\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"border-line bg-white p-[22px] shadow-card rounded-lg border\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":true,\"className\":\"font-heading flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink-strong font-bold text-white h-6 w-6 text-[0.78rem]\",\"children\":2}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-[1.1rem] font-extrabold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Plant Animal Ecosystem Importance\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ml-auto flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 border leading-none whitespace-nowrap\",\"data-accent\":\"neutral\",\"data-tone\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"bo